apps/server/uploads

# NOTE: intentionally NOT ignoring a bare `dist`.
# A bare `dist` pattern also matches apps/server/dist, which is where the
# serverless bundle (app.cjs) is written during the build. Excluding it can
# drop the bundle from the function's file trace, so /api/* returns a
# platform-level 404. Build output is regenerated on Vercel regardless.
